---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="sYnapse"
	description="Unified agentic trading platform acting as a secure multi-broker gateway, running entirely on Cloudflare edge."
>
	<p>
		<strong>sYnapse</strong> is a modern, unified agentic trading gateway designed to interface with various broker APIs, enabling secure, autonomous, and low-latency algorithmic trading. Built to run on edge infrastructure, it coordinates and executes trades on both equity and futures markets while providing real-time telemetry on active positions, capital allocation, and order statuses.
	</p>

	<h2>System Architecture</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Execution & Compute</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Runtime</td><td>Cloudflare Workers (Edge Compute)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Language</td><td>TypeScript, React (Frontend)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">UI Bundler</td><td>Vite</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">SSO Gateway</td><td>sYnID (OpenAuth.js)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Data & State</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Broker Link</td><td>Durable Objects (WebSockets)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Database</td><td>Cloudflare D1 (Serverless SQL)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Storage</td><td>Cloudflare KV (Configuration caching)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Security</td><td>Cloudflare Turnstile (Anti-Bot)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Multi-Broker Strategy Orchestration:</strong> The backend worker uses modular adapters to talk to both **Alpaca API** (equities/options) and **Tradovate API** (futures), allowing a single agentic strategy to hedge across asset classes.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Core Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Secure Broker Gateways</strong> — Handles OAuth, session refreshes, and encrypted API keys securely at the edge.</li>
		<li><strong>Durable WebSockets</strong> — Maintains constant, low-latency socket connections to broker data streams using Cloudflare Durable Objects.</li>
		<li><strong>State Management</strong> — Logs orders, trades, and strategy metrics into a serverless SQL database (D1) for analytics.</li>
		<li><strong>Single Sign-On (SSO)</strong> — Seamless authentication integration using the shared domain's sYnID provider.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Technical Organization</h2>
	<p>
		The application repository is split into a deployable edge backend and a single-page administration UI:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><code>src/worker.ts</code>: Worker API endpoints, cron executor, and static asset serving</li>
		<li><code>src/brokers/*</code>: Broker client wrappers (Alpaca, Tradovate) and authentication managers</li>
		<li><code>web/</code>: React UI dashboard for configuration, manual order override, and strategy performance visualization</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare Workers</span>
		<span class="tag">Durable Objects</span>
		<span class="tag">D1 Database</span>
		<span class="tag">React</span>
		<span class="tag">Vite</span>
		<span class="tag">OpenAuth.js</span>
		<span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
		<span class="tag">Alpaca API</span>
		<span class="tag">Tradovate API</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
